  "saint-charbel-hermitage.saint-charbel-s-hermitag.and-rising-very-early-going-out-he-went-into-a-desert-place": "“清晨，他很早起来，出去到荒僻的地方，在那里祈祷。”",
  "saint-charbel-hermitage.saint-charbel-s-hermitag.mark-1-35-douay-rheims": "马尔谷福音1:35（Douay-Rheims）",
